* Approach 1: Pass Show object to the Ticket class constructor.

Show.h:
```cpp
#pragma once

class Show {
public:
    Show(int rows, int seats): numberOfRows(rows), numberOfSeats(seats) {}
    int getNumberOfRows() const { return numberOfRows; }
    int getNumberOfSeats() const { return numberOfSeats; }

private:
    int numberOfRows, numberOfSeats;
};
```

